javac -version


5. Check JAVA_HOME
echo %JAVA_HOME%


6. Check Maven version
mvn -version



Create the project
1. Click this option:
Select this
Maven: New Project...

Do not select Spring Initializr.

2. Select Maven archetype

maven-archetype-quickstart

4. Enter project details

Use these values:
Field	Enter
Group Id	com.example
Artifact Id	demo
Version	1.0-SNAPSHOT
Package	com.example


5. Open App.java
Navigate to:
src → main → java → com → example → App.java

package com.example;

public class App {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        System.out.println("Hello from Maven Project!");

    }
}


Navigate to:
src → test → java → com → example → AppTest.java

package com.example;

import org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;
import static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertTrue;

public class AppTest {

    @Test
    public void testApp() {

        assertTrue(true);

    }
